      "writtenOn": "2026-07-06T02:54:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`register_dependency` takes `source` by value, so the list/dict branches below clone it once per dependency.\n\nThe only impl just reads it via `.get()`, so if the trait took `\u0026Self::TargetRef` I think we could safely drop these clones.\n\nNot a blocker, just noticed and thought I\u0027d mention it.",
      "revId": "67a01027d8467b6bc48d2550a7bc8f22818cfdcd",
      "serverId": "c360c8e5-7aa8-3905-a7a0-810934766dac"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "45eb92c1_5dba7bcc",
        "filename": "src/gn/starlark/crates/attr/src/attr.rs",
        "patchSetId": 8
      },
      "lineNbr": 246,
      "author": {
        "id": 3810482
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-07-06T03:57:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "TargetRef is a reference type, so it should be passed by value rather than reference (similar to how you always pass string_view by value in C++).",
      "parentUuid": "51391ab2_197eee5a",
      "revId": "67a01027d8467b6bc48d2550a7bc8f22818cfdcd",
      "serverId": "c360c8e5-7aa8-3905-a7a0-810934766dac"
    },
    {
