      "writtenOn": "2026-07-06T02:54:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`label_keyed_string_dict` has no `allow_files` / `allow_single_file` params, unlike `label_list` just below.\n\nThe key coercion for `LabelKeyedStringDict` still runs through `schema.file_matcher()`, but since this Starlark API can never set `allow_files`, the matcher is always `AllowFiles::None` and unqualified source-file keys get rejected as `NotALabel`.\n\nDo we want file-key support here? If so, I think we\u0027d need to forward those params the way the list variants do.",
      "revId": "67a01027d8467b6bc48d2550a7bc8f22818cfdcd",
      "serverId": "c360c8e5-7aa8-3905-a7a0-810934766dac"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
